# A79 final (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera): park the pointer bottom-right (never
# through the menu bar), dump the idle desktop, double-click HARD DISC C
# (195,35, as in A78) -> the C:\ directory window opens at the position
# TERADESK.INF's first `pos` entry gives it (teradesk-window.inf: xpos 40,
# ypos 40, work area 44x14 character cells, so the whole frame incl. sizer
# and both scroll bars is on the 640x480 screen), park again, dump twice.
# Ticks are 200 Hz after the first AES pump of the first EL0 program.
200 parkbr
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 195 35
1600 down
1603 up
1608 down
1611 up
2000 parkbr
2600 mark B_WINDOW
3000 mark C_WINDOW_2S
